Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.90,0:00:04.96,Title,0,0,0,0,,以下影片描述《超人第二部》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.20,0:00:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,当初构思及筹画开拍的过程
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.47,0:00:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些片段来自画面测试中 我们无法拍摄的桥段
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.87,0:00:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这部电影是用以纪念 克里斯多夫李维
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.38,0:00:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有他 我们绝不会相信人类能飞
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.62,0:09:16.61,Title,0,0,0,0,,《超人2》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.77,0:12:53.32,Note,0,0,0,0,,（揭开超人的秘密）
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.10,0:30:13.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（蜜月天堂饭店）
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.00,0:40:41.80,Note,0,0,0,0,,（迷雾之女四号）
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.74,0:49:14.41,Note,0,0,0,0,,（郡立警长）
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.78,1:21:32.68,Note,0,0,0,0,,（白宫投降）
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.33,1:22:19.16,Note,0,0,0,0,,（白派瑞 总编辑）
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.68,1:26:30.37,Note,0,0,0,0,,（冷静一下）
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.30,1:28:02.46,Note,0,0,0,0,,（请享用可口可乐）
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.27,1:30:18.76,Note,0,0,0,0,,（不准进入）
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.31,1:30:23.44,Note,0,0,0,0,,（准备下地狱吧 世界末日到了！）
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.68,1:45:24.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（号外 超人拯救人类 免于永恒统治）
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.25,1:46:01.31,Note,0,0,0,0,,（畅饮 可口可乐）
Dialogue: 0,1:47:03.15,1:47:04.94,Note,0,0,0,0,,（星球日报）
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.93,1:49:06.42,Note,0,0,0,0,,（超人今日休息）
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.32,1:50:35.76,Note,0,0,0,0,,（攻击吧）
Dialogue: 0,1:55:24.81,1:55:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,自70年代此片拍摄以来 人们已有更高度的认知
Dialogue: 0,1:55:28.15,1:55:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论是对皮草业 对动物造成的摧残
Dialogue: 0,1:55:30.82,1:55:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是吸烟与二手烟 造成的健康危害
Dialogue: 0,1:55:33.32,1:55:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此我将不宽恕 如本片描述般的
Dialogue: 0,1:55:35.99,1:55:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,消费香烟与皮草
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.82,0:01:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要求你们念出\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ask you now to pronounce judgment…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.96,0:01:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,判决的内容\N{\fnArial\fs30}…on those accused.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.96,0:01:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,对这些被告\N{\fnArial\fs30}On this…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.43,0:01:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,对这个无情的叛离者 他只想以暴力和破坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}This mindless aberration, whose only means of expression…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.76,0:01:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,来表现其情感\N{\fnArial\fs30}…are wanton violence and destruction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.40,0:01:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,对这个女人亚莎…\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the woman, Ursa…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.14,0:01:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,她对所有全体人类的 曲解及不合理的仇恨心态\N{\fnArial\fs30}…whose perversionsand unreasoning hatred of all mankind…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.84,0:01:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经威胁到 全体氪星的儿童\N{\fnArial\fs30}…have threatened even the childrenof the planet Krypton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.65,0:01:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一位是查德将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally, General Zod.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.51,0:02:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,创造者希望对这种预谋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chief architect of this intended revolution…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.95,0:02:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,重新建立一项秩序所作之革命 加以摧毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and author of this insidious plotto establish a new order amongst us…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.36,0:02:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好让自己仍然成为 绝对之统治者\N{\fnArial\fs30}…with himself as absolute ruler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.86,0:02:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在宣布判决的结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}The decision of the council will now be heard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.50,0:02:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,有罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guilty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.80,0:02:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有罪 - 有罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Guilty. - Guilty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.97,0:02:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,有罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guilty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.87,0:02:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,本项表决具有敌意 乔艾尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}The vote must be unanimous, Jor-El.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.81,0:02:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在已经变成你的判决\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has therefore now become your decision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.38,0:02:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你希望的话 你就判我们有罪吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You alone will condemn us if you wish…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.88,0:02:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你此要对我这件事负责了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and you alonewill be held responsible by me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.39,0:02:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会在我面前屈服的 乔艾尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will bow down before me, Jor-El.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.06,0:02:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.40,0:02:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管天长地久 你终会在我面前屈服的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter that it takes an eternity, you will bow down before me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.57,0:02:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.97,0:02:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,将来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and then one day…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.24,0:02:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你的子孙\N{\fnArial\fs30}…your heirs!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.54,0:03:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会在我面前屈服的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will bow down before me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.08,0:03:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 原谅我 - 我会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Forgive me! - I'll be back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.61,0:03:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,原谅我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.81,0:04:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你母亲诺拉寄给你 红 黄 蓝 三条毯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mother Lara has sent youthree blankets, of red, yellow and blue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.75,0:04:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们能保护你 确保你的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their protectionwill ensure your strength.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.72,0:05:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是氪石 超人 从古老家乡来的纪念品\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kryptonite, Superman.A little souvenir from the old hometown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.87,0:05:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是很厉害 超人 不过应该是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were great in your day, Superman.But it just stands to reason…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.57,0:05:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,要收拾你的时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…when it came timeto cash in your chips…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.21,0:05:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位老而有病的疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}…this old, diseased maniac…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.81,0:05:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,将成为你的主宰\N{\fnArial\fs30}…would be your banker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.18,0:05:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心肌肉过度紧绷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind over muscle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.89,0:06:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何先吻我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you kiss me first?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.36,0:06:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你待会儿不会让我吻你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It… I didn't think you'd let me later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.56,0:06:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,站一边去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand aside, now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.52,0:08:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,自由了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Free!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.12,0:12:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,新群哈密瓜 非常新鲜的哈密瓜 要买新鲜就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice fresh melons.Nice fresh melons. Get them fresh here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.25,0:12:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,用来烹饪也很好喔 你看看 最好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good for the cooking, huh?Look at this, the best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.89,0:12:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,「雷克斯路瑟的炸弹阴谋 超人拯救国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Lex Luthor's scheme bombs.Superman saves nation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.60,0:12:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,犯罪之王被判重刑 露易丝莲恩独家报导\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master criminal draws harsh sentence.Exclusive story by Lois Lane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.20,0:12:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆欧森摄影「\N{\fnArial\fs30}Photographs by James Olsen."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.47,0:12:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷克斯路瑟 你看起来永远这么邪恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luthor, you never looked lovelier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.87,0:12:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,露易丝 做得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lois, terrific job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.21,0:12:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢了 老编 - 非常好的报导 非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks, chief. - Great story, really great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.37,0:12:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安 老编 你迟到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, good morning, chief. You're late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.71,0:12:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,莲恩小姐 这故事很棒 是最棒的之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Miss Lane, that's a great story.One of the best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.78,0:12:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆 通常一张照片 不值得我写一千字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Jimmy, usually a picture isn't worth a thousand words when I write the story…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.28,0:12:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但以这则报导来说 恭喜你\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but in this case, congratulations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.29,0:12:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多谢了 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, thanks a lot. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.72,0:12:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯特先生来了 我赌他希望 事件发生时他能在场\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's Mr. Kent. Bet he wisheshe'd been around when it all happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.33,0:12:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,超人出现时克拉克都不在场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clark, he's never around when Superman appears.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.00,0:12:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怜的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.61,0:12:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 头版还有位置吗？ - 有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got a page in the front? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.44,0:13:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,莲恩小姐有绝对正点的报导\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Lane got the best story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.15,0:13:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安 露易丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, Lois.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.82,0:13:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.23,0:13:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,莲恩 肯特 进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lane, Kent, get in here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.70,0:13:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,看吧 吉姆 你害我有麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, see, Jimmy, you got me in trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.70,0:14:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们刚刚正在谈话 - 再见 是个天大的错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We were talking. - So long. A big mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.70,0:14:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一次别这样对我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next time, don't do that to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.37,0:14:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早安 露易丝 你今天好吗？ - 非常好 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good morning, Lois. How are you today? - Oh, I'm just super. Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.08,0:14:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早安 白先生 - 我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good morning, Mr. White. - I'm super.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.01,0:14:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早安 你迟到了 肯特 - 我知道 很抱歉 白先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, morning. You're late, Kent. - I know. I'm sorry, Mr. White.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.55,0:14:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 路上塞车 - 又有新借口了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got stuck in traffic. - Oh, that's a new one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.98,0:14:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说什么？ - 我是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me? - I mean, as opposed to:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.85,0:14:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了「我被卡在电话亭里」或「我被锁在男厕里」之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I was stuck in a phone booth" or"I got locked into the men's bathroom."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.56,0:14:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,露易丝 你在说什么？ 我很抱歉我迟到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lois, what are you talking about?I'm sorry I was late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.26,0:14:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想吵闹的话 我刚好有任务给你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you two wanna bicker, I have just the assignment for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.26,0:14:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要扮成蜜月小夫妻 参加一个新婚宴会\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna pose as a honeymoon coupleto get an expos?on the newlywed racket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.43,0:14:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些饭店压榨这些可怜孩子的微薄收入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of those hotels are bilkingthose poor kids for every cent they can get.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.34,0:14:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是条令人成兴趣的新闻 保证那些婆婆妈妈痛哭流涕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real human-interest stuff.Make your Aunt Hattie cry her eyes out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.84,0:14:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 新婚夫妇？ - 这主意真棒 白先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Newlyweds? - That is a great idea, Mr. White.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.04,0:14:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 但我正在追踪一系列…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, but I'm in the middle of a series…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.25,0:14:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不会花上你很多时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it wouldn't take long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.09,0:14:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以直接飞过去 再飞回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could just fly right up thereand zoom back down again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.52,0:14:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好吗 超人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Superman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.96,0:14:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 要是他愿意载你们一程 也许我们能省下一些钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. If he'd give you two a ride, maybe we could save a couple bucks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.53,0:14:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要找小欧森 六张龌龊的照片…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta see young Olsen.Six lousy photographs…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.96,0:15:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那小子还一直吵加薪\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and that kid's hitting me up for a raise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.58,0:15:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 白先生 我们能谈谈吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Mr. White? Could we talk?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.50,0:15:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.03,0:15:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来像吞了一只金丝雀的猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look like the cat who swallowedthe canary this morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.10,0:15:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,金丝雀？才不 是更大的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}A canary? No, actually I wasthinking of something bigger…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.11,0:15:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种会飞的 颜色更蓝的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}…something that flies, something more in blue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.41,0:15:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,露易丝 我和以往一样 身陷黑暗中…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lois, as usual, I'm totally in the dark…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.65,0:15:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我为你把灯点亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me just turn on the lights for you then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.82,0:15:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the picture?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.49,0:15:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到现在才拼凑出全貌 真的蛮有趣的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't put this together untilthis morning. Which is really strange…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.16,0:15:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为一名记者 绝不会忽略任何细节\N{\fnArial\fs30}…because a good reporter isn't supposed to let anything slip by her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.73,0:15:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那很有趣 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's very amusing. Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.33,0:15:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不好意思 - 有趣？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me. - Amusing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.97,0:15:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 非常有趣 - 有趣是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, sirree, that's… That's very amusing. - Amusing, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.61,0:15:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,高大 宽阔的肩膀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tall, broad shoulders…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.11,0:15:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,深色头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}…dark hair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.31,0:15:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得承认你伪装的很成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta give you credit, you really had me fooled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.42,0:15:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有骗任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm nobody's fool…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.82,0:15:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Superman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.02,0:16:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,超人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Superman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.52,0:16:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说你以为我是超人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean you think I'm Superman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.19,0:16:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意用生命作赌注\N{\fnArial\fs30}Willing to bet my life on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.10,0:16:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,露易丝 你知道吗？你是无价的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lois, you know, you are priceless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.63,0:16:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的 那是我知道最可笑的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really. That is the single mostridiculous thing I've ever…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.94,0:16:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 露易丝 你在做什么？ - 你不会让我死的 超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lois, what are you doing? - You wouldn't let me die, Superman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.88,0:17:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老天 - 救她出来 救她出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, God. - Help her out. Help her out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.92,0:17:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 克拉克 - 露易丝 你做了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Clark! - Lois, what have you done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.15,0:17:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,克拉克 你不是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clark, the… You're not…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.39,0:17:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,克拉克 你有见到露易丝吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Clark, you seen Lois?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.66,0:17:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,她刚刚出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She just stepped out for a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.88,0:17:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是本世代最伟大罪犯的下场\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is how it ends forthe greatest criminal mind of our time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.05,0:17:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人哭也没有人闹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not with a whimper, not with a bang.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.45,0:17:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们将如何纪念雷克斯路瑟\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do they choose to reward Lex Luthor…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.19,0:17:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位世上最伟大的天才？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the greatest genius in this world?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.29,0:17:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们给他荣耀还是宝藏？ 说实话 他们给了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do they give him glory or treasure?What, matter of fact, do they give him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.36,0:17:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,终生监禁外加廿五年 快工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life plus 25, Luthor. Get to work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.77,0:18:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,别伤心 路瑟先生 你差点就成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't feel bad, Mr. Luthor.It almost worked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.58,0:18:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的是加州差点就沉入海底\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, California almost fell down, right in the ocean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.58,0:18:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,百万人几乎丧命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Millions of people was almost killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.55,0:18:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是超人 那个成长过度的男童军\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it hadn't been for that guy Superman, that overgrown Boy Scout.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.92,0:18:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 今晚我将要回我的自由 - 今晚？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I want my Liberace record back tonight. - Tonight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.32,0:18:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种人你要怎么对付？ 他飞那么快又什么都会\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do with a guy like that?He flies around so fast and everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.39,0:18:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至连雷达都无法追踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, they can't even tracethat guy on that radar they got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.80,0:18:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要他们想追踪 他马上飞走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time they try, he just flies off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.90,0:18:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 往哪个方向？ - 北方\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where? - North.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.47,0:18:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.44,0:18:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了去滑雪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}To ski?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.90,0:18:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧提斯 每个人都有弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otis, every man has his vulnerable point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.47,0:18:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,像你这种人的弱点不止一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some, like you, Otis, have more than one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.84,0:18:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没能及时看到超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't see Superman's in time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.98,0:18:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在通过耐心 创造力及技术\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now, through patience, invention, and skill…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.65,0:18:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的小黑箱就快完成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…my little black boxis just about ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.92,0:18:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们囚房中的小黑箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that little black box in our cell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.16,0:18:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个小黑箱 路瑟先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}That little black box, Mr. Luthor…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.77,0:18:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那有什么用途？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…what's it for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.83,0:19:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个小黑箱比传统雷达有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}That little black box goes beyond any normal, conventional radar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.81,0:19:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,它能追踪阿尔法波\N{\fnArial\fs30}It tracks alpha waves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.98,0:19:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿尔法波\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alpha waves. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.81,0:19:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以说这模仿青豆面条 是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could've said it tracked pasta e fagioli, couldn't I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.72,0:19:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,要加上大蒜和奶油 路瑟先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, with garlic, Mr. Luthor. And butter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.52,0:19:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.06,0:19:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿尔法波能引我到北极 到他的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those alpha waves willtake me north to his secret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.83,0:19:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我知道超人的秘密 我就不怕他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when I have his secret, I'll have Superman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.41,0:19:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,屠杀者佛吉斯顿是个尿床小鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slasher Fogelstein's a bed wetter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.85,0:19:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,屠杀者佛吉斯顿是个尿床小鬼 传下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slasher Fogelstein's a bed wetter.Pass it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.26,0:19:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 佛吉斯顿先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Mr. Fogelstein.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.73,0:20:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,太快了 你能用正常速度吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}too fast. Can you get the speed right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.36,0:20:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你 他们三周前就装好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, they installed thosethree weeks ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.17,0:20:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.10,0:20:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来监视一下这跳动符号 它让我头很痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You follow the bouncing ball for a while.Thing's giving me a headache.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.50,0:20:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 派人去查看那些家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, somebody's gotta check up on those guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.77,0:20:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得对 我老是把他们忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I keep on forgetting about them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.78,0:20:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在上面多久了？45天？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long they been up there, 45 days?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.71,0:20:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,全世界都已将我们遗忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole world's forgotten about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.89,0:20:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,休士顿呼叫阿特蜜丝二号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Houston calling Artemis II.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.86,0:20:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,休士顿呼叫阿特蜜丝二号 请回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}Houston calling Artemis II. Come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.86,0:20:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早安 休士顿 - 等一下 纳特\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Morning, Houston. - Hold on, Nate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.59,0:20:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂 - 情况如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yo. - How are things going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.30,0:20:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切系统都很正常 休士顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}All systems normal, Houston.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.93,0:20:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪正在外面进行地质调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy is out doing the geological survey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.97,0:20:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,更多石头\N{\fnArial\fs30}More rocks. Nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.47,0:20:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,柯斯墨诺伯里斯正在采土样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And cosmonaut Borisis getting some soil samples.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.74,0:20:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 伯里斯跟我订婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, Boris and I are engaged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.81,0:20:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我看到你的罗夏墨渍测验时 心中已经有数\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a feeling about you guyswhen I saw your Rorschach tests.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.12,0:20:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是闲玩笑舒缓一下 休士顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a little detente humor there, Houston.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.58,0:20:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,表面状况没有改变吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surface conditions unchanged?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.75,0:21:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,外太空的景色非常美丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's mightypretty out there. Mighty…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.92,0:21:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 非常美丽… - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …pretty. - Mighty pretty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.16,0:21:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.66,0:21:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 纳特…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Nate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.73,0:21:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳特 专心点好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nate, wake up, will you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.50,0:21:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我是在作梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. I'm dreaming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.24,0:21:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿特蜜丝 请回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}Artemis, come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.67,0:21:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,休士顿 这里好像出现不明飞行物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Houston, we seem to havean unidentified flying object.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.94,0:21:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不明飞行物？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unidentified?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.01,0:21:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它是什么样子？ - 很像是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What does it look like? - Well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.88,0:21:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a lot like a girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.84,0:21:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.37,0:21:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是何种生物？ - 我是个男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What kind of a creature are you? - Just a man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.65,0:21:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是男人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.50,0:22:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,真脆弱的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a fragile sort of life form this is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.60,0:23:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,休士顿 请回答 休士顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Houston, come in. Come in, Houston.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.78,0:23:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,请回答 休士顿 请回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in, Houston. Come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.31,0:23:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,尝试手动起飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attempting manual liftoff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.15,0:23:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人听到我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can somebody hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.88,0:23:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,休士顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Houston!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.92,0:23:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.72,0:23:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点啊 休士顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Houston!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.39,0:23:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.33,0:23:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁来救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.80,0:24:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 休士顿呼叫阿特蜜丝 请回答 - 怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Artemis, Houston calling. Come in. - What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.97,0:24:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不知道 我们失去连系了 - 所以呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know. We've lost contact. - So?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.58,0:24:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we really…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.84,0:24:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿特蜜丝 请回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}Artemis, come in, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.02,0:24:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你们谁在用吹风机？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, which one of you guysis using the hair dryer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.09,0:24:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好奇怪 那些金属我撕起来像在撕纸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strange. I tore those metal fibers like paper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.09,0:24:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他的举动 真是太惊人了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what he did was amazing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.20,0:24:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有些改变发生了 - 没错 我们三个都一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Something is happening. - Yes, to all of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.84,0:24:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们愈接近 只有一个太阳的大气层\N{\fnArial\fs30}The closer we come to anatmosphere with only one sun…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.21,0:24:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个黄色的太阳…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a yellow sun…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.21,0:24:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的分子密度愈大 也给予我们无穷的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the more our moleculardensity gives us unlimited powers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.35,0:24:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来自那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}They come from there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.32,0:24:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个叫做休士顿的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}A place called Houston.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.49,0:24:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我们也去那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we will go there too…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.05,0:24:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,去统治那个星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to rule.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.46,0:24:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于…能够统治星球了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally, to rule.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.57,0:25:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,382室 熄灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three-eighty-two, out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.24,0:25:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,383室 熄灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three-eighty-three, out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.38,0:25:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,384室 熄灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three-eighty-four, out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.58,0:25:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,385室 熄灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three-eighty-five, out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.25,0:25:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,熄灯 路瑟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lights out, Luthor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.19,0:25:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫你熄灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, lights out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.99,0:25:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,再十秒我就会进去找你们 听到了没有？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys are about 10 seconds away from solitary, you know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.77,0:25:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫你们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.28,0:25:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要动 不要动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze, freeze.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.32,0:26:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,路瑟先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Luthor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.59,0:26:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们要怎么越过那道墙？ - 我们怎么进来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How we gonna get over that wall? - How'd we get in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.89,0:26:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们飞进来的 记得吗？ - 那我们就飞出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We flew in here, remember? - That's how we'll get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.63,0:26:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是那家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, not that guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.77,0:26:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚叫我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you just go "psst"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.67,0:26:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望我有 路瑟先生 在我们离开前\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I had, Mr. Luthor, before we left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.47,0:26:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是那个 是那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that "psst, " that "psst."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.11,0:27:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当我这样时别那样 - 你去做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't go "psst" when I go "psst." - You do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.85,0:27:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,快出去找一找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go out there and find it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.29,0:27:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要找什么？ - 你看到时说会知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What am I looking for? - You'll know when you see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.94,0:27:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I found it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.81,0:27:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.68,0:27:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个楼梯 傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a ladder, you dummy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.32,0:27:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,黛丝玛克小姐 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Miss Teschmacher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.73,0:27:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.70,0:27:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,动作快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up. Hurry up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.90,0:27:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,快一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, hurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.14,0:27:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧提斯 抓住楼梯 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otis, hold that ladder. Hurry up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.67,0:28:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,码线 达阵 喔 打得真是太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}yard line, touchdown!Oh, what a beautiful play.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.68,0:28:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过裁判丢了手帕 它可能是某队犯规…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there's a marker down field.It could be against…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.99,0:28:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上来啊 - 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come up. - Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.22,0:28:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了 路瑟先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here I come, Mr. Luthor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.42,0:28:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 下去 下去 - 欧提斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get off. Get off. - Otis!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.56,0:28:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 欧提斯 我们在往下掉 - 下去 快下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're sinking! - Get off, get off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.28,0:28:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,黛丝玛克小姐 你做得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very good, Miss Teschmacher. Very good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.62,0:28:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我来这里干嘛？我为什么在这里？ - 黛丝玛克小姐…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What am I doing here? Why am I here? - Miss Teschmacher…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.52,0:28:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是哲学课吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is this a philosophy seminar?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.55,0:28:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这是通道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. This is a getaway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.46,0:28:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 通道？ - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Getaway. - Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.86,0:28:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很天才 我不知道你哪儿来的灵感\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's ingenious. I don't know where you got the inspiration from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.06,0:28:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,从你那里得来的 雷克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it from you, Lex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.70,0:28:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,热气上升\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hot air rises.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.47,0:29:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想来赵旅行吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like to take a trip?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.40,0:29:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,旅行？放大假吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A trip? A vacation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.81,0:29:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷克斯 我可以去血拼 买件比基尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lex, I can go shopping.I can buy a bikini.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.22,0:29:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要我在监狱里穿着比基尼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thought about me in a bikiniwhile in prison?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.61,0:29:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我其实没那么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I didn't, actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.11,0:29:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想的你是穿着毛皮外套\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought about you in a parka.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.55,0:29:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我穿毛皮外套？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thought about me in a parka?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.82,0:29:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很病态 雷克斯 你真的病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are sick, Lex. You are really sick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.82,0:29:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.13,0:29:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,往北 黛丝玛克小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}North, Miss Teschmacher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.10,0:29:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,正北方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Due north.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.63,0:29:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷克斯 北方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lex, north.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.64,0:29:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我所说的 正北方\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I said, due north.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.27,0:29:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的确说过 - 我知道我说我说过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's what you said. - I know I said I said that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.84,0:29:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我刚刚才听到 - 对 雷克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I just heard it. - Yes, Lex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.78,0:29:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,别重复我说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't repeat what I say when I say something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.31,0:29:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不会重复你说的话 - 好 别重复就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I won't repeat what you say. - Okay, don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.65,0:29:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再重复我的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, stop repeating me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.38,0:30:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.78,0:30:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是否想抱着史密斯太太 进入门槛…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like to carry Mrs. Smith over the threshold?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.12,0:30:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一种传统\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's sort of traditional.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.05,0:30:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你抱不动 我可以帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can give you a handif you have trouble lifting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.06,0:30:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不用了 当然不用 - 亲爱的 谢谢 我自己走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, of course not. - Honey. Thanks, I'll walk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.73,0:30:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Certainly, dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.54,0:30:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mush! Mush!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.57,0:30:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经在跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am mushing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.91,0:30:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,往北 黛丝玛克小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}North, Miss Teschmacher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.05,0:30:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 往北 往北 - 是的 雷克斯 往北\N{\fnArial\fs30}- North, north! - Yes, Lex. North.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.55,0:31:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定弄错了 雷克斯 这种地方 一定不是他的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you must be wrong, Lex.This couldn't be his home way up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.95,0:31:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,「你错了 雷克斯」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Wrong, Lex."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.85,0:31:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,黛丝玛克小姐 不能出现在同 那两个词 个句子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Teschmacher, those are two words we do not use in the same sentence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.59,0:31:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很古怪 它没有大门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's funny there's no front door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.63,0:31:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,「古怪」 黛丝玛克小姐 是指有人笑不露齿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Teschmacher, "funny" is a person trying to smile without any teeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.90,0:31:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.44,0:31:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 过来 雷克斯 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, come on, Lex. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.78,0:31:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move out of the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.78,0:32:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这边 - 是这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This way. - It's this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.65,0:32:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷克斯 是这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lex, it's this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.58,0:32:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这边 雷克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's this way, Lex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.89,0:32:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧 来啊 - 别碰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. Come on. - Get off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.66,0:32:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.17,0:32:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太好了 - 太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fantastic. - Fantastic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.94,0:32:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fantastic!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.18,0:32:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前所知的建筑理论 都无法完成这栋建筑物\N{\fnArial\fs30}The construction goes far beyondany known architectural theory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.19,0:32:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的是很美 - 很美\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's beautiful. - It's beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.03,0:32:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 雷克斯 - 我没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lex. - I'll be all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.53,0:32:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.03,0:32:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不能更小心一点？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why can't you be more careful?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.37,0:32:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的是很美 - 很美\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's beautiful. - Beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.21,0:33:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这里什么都有 - 错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It has everything. - Wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.04,0:33:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们出发前 你为何不去上？ - 那是两天前的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why didn't you go before we left? - That was two days ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.78,0:33:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点 雷克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful, Lex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.22,0:33:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.56,0:33:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,坦白说我觉得这地方有点无聊 到处一片洁白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frankly, I think this placeis a little boring. It's all white.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.56,0:33:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙赶麻不放些照片上去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why doesn't the guy put up some pictures?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.03,0:33:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许可以放些斗牛海报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe some bullfighting posters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.57,0:33:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么都别碰 - 什么都别碰\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't touch anything. - Don't touch anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.54,0:33:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是冰 - 我说过别碰它\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ice. - I said, don't touch it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.34,0:33:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这不是冰 - 看起来像是水晶\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's not ice. - It looks like a crystal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.07,0:34:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,正直的灵魂 不需要别人的感谢…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The virtuous spirit has no need for thankful approval…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.07,0:34:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 搞什么？ - 来获得一些肯定…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the… - Owning a certain conviction…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.44,0:34:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,确定自己做的那件事是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that what has been done is right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.45,0:34:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是他老爸 他看起来跟超人很像\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the old man.He looks just like the kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.85,0:34:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你就是老爸吗？ - 问他厕所在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you the old man? - Ask him where the bathroom is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.75,0:34:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须靠自己来肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Develop such conviction in yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.52,0:34:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.96,0:34:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在你的星球上的人心 - 他不在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The human heart on your planet… - He's not here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.13,0:34:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这声音来自过去 真聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a voice from the past.That's cute. That's really cute. Nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.63,0:34:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,谎言 骇人听闻的诡计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lies, monstrous deceptions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.97,0:34:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,真会说教\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much for moral rearmament.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.64,0:34:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我另一块水晶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me another crystal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.38,0:34:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,第108号教育水晶 地球文化\N{\fnArial\fs30}Education crystal 108. Earth culture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.66,0:34:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是地球人们 相当喜爱的一首词赋 凯尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}A typical ode much loved by the people you will live among, Kal-El.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.89,0:35:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔尹斯基尔默讲述「树」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trees by Joyce Kilmer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.06,0:35:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我认为我永远不会看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I think that I shall never see{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.07,0:35:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,一首如树木般美丽的诗「\N{\fnArial\fs30}A poem as lovely as a tree."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.90,0:35:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 我喜欢树木\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, I like trees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.57,0:35:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那只柯卡猎犬也一样 再给我另外一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}So does your average cocker spaniel.Give me another.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.24,0:35:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.35,0:35:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的儿子…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.82,0:35:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他长生不老 - 长生不老\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The man never ages. - Never ages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.82,0:35:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是该告诉你我们星球历史中 的黑暗时期了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the time has come to tell you of the darkest episode in Krypton history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.12,0:35:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这才是我想听的 - 很不幸地…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now, this I wanna hear. - Unfortunately…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.03,0:35:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使在我们平静的星球上\N{\fnArial\fs30}…even on our peaceful planet…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.63,0:35:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些扰乱世界的元素\N{\fnArial\fs30}…there have appearedonce in a great while…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.03,0:35:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,依旧每隔一阵子出现一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}…certain antisocial elements.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.64,0:35:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,异常者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deviants…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.21,0:35:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是地球上所说的罪犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}…what you call on Earth "criminals."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.37,0:35:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,罪犯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Criminals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.81,0:35:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,异常者 他一开始就说对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deviants. He was right in the first place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.48,0:35:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我们不像地球一样 是个苦难的星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though of course, we are nota penalty planet like Earth…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.61,0:35:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些不快乐的灵魂 几乎全数成功转换为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and these unhappy souls were almostalways successfully transformed…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.39,0:36:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 奉公守法的市民 - 你没听过雷克斯路瑟吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …into productive citizens. - You never heard of Lex Luthor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.49,0:36:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有三者例外 只有这三者\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were, however, three exceptions… Only three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.89,0:36:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,证明了自己不可能脱离邪恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}who proved impossible to rehabilitate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.83,0:36:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.63,0:36:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,零 是毁灭者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Non, the destroyer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.97,0:36:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,以人类的形体进行无理由的暴力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unreasoning violence in the shape of a being.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.17,0:36:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚莎 邪恶又残忍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ursa. Vicious, cruel, obsessed by a single-minded hatred…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.17,0:36:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,一心被无法确定的仇恨驱使\N{\fnArial\fs30}…which could never be determined.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.24,0:36:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一股汇集他们的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the one force that could unite them…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.51,0:36:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一能以他异常的聪颖 驾驭邪恶力量的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the only one whose warped genius could harness these forces of evil:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.25,0:36:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,查德将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}General Zod.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.69,0:36:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他看起来满可爱的 - 他意图叛乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He looks kind of cute. - His intended insurrection…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.75,0:36:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我们人民最痛苦的一段历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}…was the most painful episode our people ever had to endure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.49,0:36:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,在漫长恐怖的一役后\N{\fnArial\fs30}But after a long and terrible battle…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.16,0:36:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,星球再次恢复和平与和谐\N{\fnArial\fs30}…peace and harmony were once again restored.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.00,0:36:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,满令人扫兴的结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of an anticlimax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.70,0:36:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们并没有死刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had, of course, no death penalty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.44,0:36:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常合理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sensible enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.57,0:36:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们因而被封印在幽灵区\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so they were placed in the Phantom Zone…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.95,0:37:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远监禁他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to be imprisoned for all eternity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.28,0:37:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们并不知道 若让他们逃走会有什么后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not know what could be done if they were to escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.22,0:37:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,在氪星 无法控制这些恶徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}On Krypton, thesevillains were uncontrollable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.62,0:37:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,在地球上 他们每个人 都可能拥有强大的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}On Earth, each of them would have the identical powers…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.30,0:37:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你的力量完全一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that you have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.80,0:37:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想看 有三名超级恶徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think of it. Three super villains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.10,0:37:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人的力量都跟他一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}All three with the same power he has.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.14,0:37:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一位都具都有毁坏 暴力及邪恶倾向\N{\fnArial\fs30}All three totally dedicated to corruption, violence, evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.24,0:37:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们需要一位地球联络人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They need a contact on Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.31,0:37:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,和他们拥有同样感受的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone who felt the same as they did, someone who…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.32,0:37:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,某位与他们同样争取生命自由 并追求快乐的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…had the same wonderful contempt for life, liberty and the pursuit of happiness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.56,0:37:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,一位好的不可思议的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too true to be good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.93,0:37:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.80,0:37:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 黛丝玛克小姐？ - 我找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Miss Teschmacher? - I found it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.07,0:37:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.41,0:38:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我需要吉姆时 他在哪里？ - 风景真美 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's Jimmy Olsen when I need him? - Golly, isn't it beautiful?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.68,0:38:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,太美了 美极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's gorgeous. Gorgeous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.75,0:38:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 露易丝 - 什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lois? - Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.18,0:38:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 每个人都牵着手 或许我们也该牵手？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. Everybody's holding hands.Maybe we should hold hands too, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.19,0:38:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 克拉克 牵着我的手吧 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here's my hand, Clark. Hold it. - Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.12,0:38:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？他们都不敢放手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? They're afraid to let go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.86,0:38:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么？ - 因为他们一放手就会离婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - They let go, straight to the lawyer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.96,0:38:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这点我并不清楚 我觉得他们看来都很快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I don't know about that.They look kind of happy to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.00,0:38:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你视而不见 克拉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's because you're blind, Clark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.80,0:38:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吧 - 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, yeah. - Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.47,0:38:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不用了 我戴着就行 - 克拉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, I've got it. No, I… - Yeah. Clark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.47,0:38:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得好好照顾自己 你只有一双眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've gotta look after yourself.You've only got one pair of eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.84,0:38:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 - 露易丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- God. - Lois?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.68,0:38:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拿去 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now, here. - Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.01,0:38:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别说我什么都没做… - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't say I never did anything for you. - Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.55,0:38:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son! Excuse me, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.15,0:38:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小心点 - 你在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Be careful. - What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.85,0:38:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,下来 快下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down! Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.53,0:38:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在众人面前害我丢脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You embarrass me here in front of everybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.40,0:39:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到差点出事了吗？ 那个小男孩…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lois, did you see what almost happened there? That little boy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.67,0:39:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我饿了 你饿了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm hungry. You hungry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.91,0:39:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 露易丝 你真是不可思议 - 因为我肚子饿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lois, you're amazing. - Why, because I'm hungry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.41,0:39:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 站在自然界中 最壮观的景色之前…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Here you are standing in front of one of nature's most awesome spectacles…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.41,0:39:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你只想到要吃东西 难道你不为美景所震撼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and you're thinking about food. Aren't you impressed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.58,0:39:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,克拉克 当女孩子看过行动中的超人后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clark, once a girl's seen Superman in action…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.19,0:39:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼亚加拉瀑布只会让你觉得冷 你了解我的意思吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Niagara Falls kind of leaves you cold, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.86,0:39:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Him again, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.69,0:39:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.33,0:39:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的心胸很狭窄的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a one-track mind, don't I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.76,0:39:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我狭窄的心胸告诉我 我饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, my one-track mind is telling me that I'm hungry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.10,0:39:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 吃热狗好吗？ - 吃热狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hot dog? - Hot dog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.40,0:39:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,热狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hot dog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.93,0:39:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还要柳橙汁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could I have some orange juice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.60,0:39:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现榨的 - 现榨的 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Freshly squeezed. - Freshly squeezed, I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.08,0:39:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 妈 你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Mom. Look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.25,0:39:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, honey. That's nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.09,0:39:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我要两个加芥末和碎酸黄瓜的 还有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, it's two mustard and relish, and…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.26,0:40:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.86,0:40:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.60,0:40:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.57,0:40:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来人帮帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.27,0:40:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,快帮忙啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do something!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.64,0:40:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.95,0:40:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Superman!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.98,0:40:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好 超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Way to go, Superman!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.15,0:40:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们拍到一个好镜头\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a great shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.42,0:40:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是个大好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a nice man.Of course he's Jewish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.06,0:40:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不可思议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incredible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.10,0:40:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你到了 - 再飞一次 再飞一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There you go. - Again, again!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.57,0:40:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 每个人只能飞一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm sorry.Only one ride to a customer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.98,0:40:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 超人 超人 是我 露易丝 - 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Superman. Superman, it's me, it's Lois! - Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.11,0:40:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 我要好好修理你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here. You're gonna get it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.48,0:41:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你害我差点心脏病发作 - 是我 露易丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Give me a heart attack here. - It's me. It's Lois.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.09,0:41:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是露易丝·莲啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Lois Lane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.82,0:41:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, hello and goodbye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.85,0:41:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是休士顿星吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is planet Houston.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.36,0:41:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好奇怪的地表\N{\fnArial\fs30}A very strange surface.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.35,0:42:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的天啊 - 没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my gosh. - Oh, that's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.91,0:42:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我只是没听见你敲门 此这样 - 露易丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I just didn't hear you knock, that's all. - Lois…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.93,0:42:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,门根本没锁 任何人都进得来\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the door wasn't even locked.Just anybody can walk in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.71,0:42:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你又把自己比喻为凡人了 - 很幽默\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There you go putting yourself down again. - Very funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.51,0:42:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我很认真\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, really, I'm serious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.60,0:42:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, anyway…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.50,0:42:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是给今晚新婚晚宴的一点小东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}…here, a little something forthe newlyweds' dinner tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.91,0:42:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是紫罗兰 克拉克 这很… 很特别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pansies. Clark, how…How different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.74,0:42:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相信它们在这儿 都是野生的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you believethey grow wild all around here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.25,0:42:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该看看花店里玫瑰的价格\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should see what they charge for roses at the gift shop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.85,0:42:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll bet, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.95,0:42:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道吗 露易丝？ - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know something, Lois? - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.85,0:42:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了这件事的不真实以外…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know, in spite of the unreality of all this…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.53,0:42:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 为了报导装扮成新婚夫妻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know, posing as newlyweds for the sake of a newspaper story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.96,0:42:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了我自己甚至都…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, in spite of myself even…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.20,0:42:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我闻始觉得自己是其中之一了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I'm kind of starting to feel like one in a way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.10,0:42:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 新婚夫妻 你？ - 我不觉得那有什么好奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A newlywed, you? - I don't see why that should be so strange.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.87,0:42:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我不是那个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I didn't mean that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.64,0:43:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 我确定有成千上万的女孩愿意…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I'm sure there's thousands of girls who'd…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.31,0:43:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少有几个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, a few girls anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.28,0:43:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 尽管说出来 - 说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go ahead and say it. - Say what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.45,0:43:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,说你不满意和我一起待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}That somehow you're not satisfied being here with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.95,0:43:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在你眼里看来不太完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}That in some way I don't seem to shape up very well in your eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.96,0:43:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无需为任何事道歉 我是个好记者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have anything to apologize for.I'm a good reporter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.96,0:43:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我是个非常好的记者 还是你更好的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm a very good reporter.And an even better friend to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.00,0:43:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 站起来 - 站起来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stand up. - Stand up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.80,0:43:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 站起来 好玩嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, stand up, just for fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.77,0:43:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来这里 看看你自己 看看你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, come here. Look at yourself.Just look at yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.41,0:43:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个有潜在攻击性 与威胁性的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we have here is a potentially aggressive, dynamite guy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.75,0:43:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能呼风唤雨\N{\fnArial\fs30}…who can do anything he wants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.52,0:43:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我的错 你一直自贬身价\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's not my fault you keep putting yourself down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.42,0:43:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗？怎么说？ - 首先\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, yeah? How? - Well, for starters…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.59,0:43:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你装作一副笨拙的样子 来 站直\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you slouch all the time.Here, stand up straight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.26,0:43:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There, that's better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.99,0:43:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,替自己买件有开口的夹克 和不用带子束紧的鞋\N{\fnArial\fs30}And get yourself a jacket with a vent and shoes that don't lace up…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.63,0:44:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,和一件有点颜色 或图形之类的衬衫\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and a shirt with a little color or a pattern or something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.75,0:44:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,和一个看起来不像拆信刀的领结\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a bow tie that doesn't look like a letter opener.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.37,0:44:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 露慧丝 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Lois. All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.81,0:44:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们讨论过这个了不是？ - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We've been through this, haven't we? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.04,0:44:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这一切的结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know where this is all leading to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.38,0:44:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 我很抱歉…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm sorry. I mean, I'm sorry…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.35,0:44:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论我多努力尝试 我就是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but no matter how hard I try, I just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.39,0:44:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是永远不会变成他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just… Just never will be him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.12,0:44:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Him who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.66,0:44:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,「他是谁」 ？当然是超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Him who"? Him Superman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.33,0:44:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你似乎以为自己爱他 我无力改变这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I can't help the fact thatyou seem to think that you love him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.73,0:44:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我要忍受的地方 可恶 露易丝 我受够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's something I'll have to live with.But darn it, Lois, that's enough now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.54,0:44:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我受够和他较劲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I just can't stand the competition anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.24,0:44:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你一直以来就是那个对手？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And just maybe you've been the competition all along.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.74,0:44:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,露易丝 我从不擅长猜谜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lois, I've never been particularly good at riddles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.34,0:44:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我把话说白一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me make this one really easy for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.85,0:44:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,全世界有无数孩子可能身陷危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, with thousands of children potentially falling off something lethal…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.92,0:44:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么超人今天会在尼加拉瀑布？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…all around the world, would Superman be in Niagara Falls today?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.99,0:44:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不是大峡谷？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not the Grand Canyon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.56,0:44:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,问问孩子的家人 他们知道答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask the child's family. I'm sure they know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.42,0:45:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何每次都是我和你在一起…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is it always when I'm with you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.56,0:45:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到超人现身？ 然复你似乎就消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…until Superman appears?And then you seem to disappear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.20,0:45:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我一直觉得这巧合并不单纯 - 天啊 我是去买热狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Very conveniently, it seems to me. - I was out for hot dogs. For Pete's sake…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.10,0:45:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,当超人来到现场时 我转头看热狗摊\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Superman appeared, I looked at that hot dog stand…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.00,0:45:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and you were gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.37,0:45:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是… - 消失无踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was… - Nowhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.11,0:45:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非去不可也没办法…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't help it if I had to go to the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.91,0:45:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是超人 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are Superman, aren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.28,0:45:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,露易丝 我们以前就谈过 你的这种幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lois, look, we've been through these hallucinations of yours before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.95,0:45:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你差点做了什么事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't you see what you almost did?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.85,0:45:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,从30楼高跳下？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throwing yourself off a building 30 stories high?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.39,0:45:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道那差点 铸成不幸的错误吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't you see the tragic mistake you almost made?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.86,0:45:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我的确是犯了错 因为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I made a mistake.I made a mistake because…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.60,0:45:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用的生命冒险 而不是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I risked my life instead of yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.77,0:45:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,露易丝 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lois, don't be insane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.97,0:45:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,别想假装倒下去 因为你还得站起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And don't fall down because you're just gonna have to get up again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.37,0:45:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,露易丝 别闹了 露易丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lois, now, don't be crazy now. Lois!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.32,0:46:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.76,0:46:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我一定知道很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I've known this for the longest time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.67,0:46:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You realize, of course…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.64,0:46:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,若猜错的话 克拉克肯特就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…if you'd been wrong, Clark Kent would have been killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.51,0:46:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,用空包弹也会死吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a blank?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.15,0:46:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,骗到你了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotcha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.67,0:46:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,多么原始的生命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}A primitive sort of life form.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.52,0:47:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.05,0:47:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see what I did?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.39,0:47:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拥有超凡的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have powers beyond reason here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.29,0:47:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们三个都有 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all have them, my dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.53,0:47:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这里就是你家 - 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wow, this is your home? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.84,0:48:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上我住在城里 离你家三条街而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, I live in the city, about three blocks from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.38,0:48:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里对我是个很特殊的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, this is a very special place for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.88,0:48:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想让你看看这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted you to see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.58,0:48:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你感觉够暖和吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, you warm enough?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.05,0:48:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该觉得冷 但我并不冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I should be freezing, but I'm not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.29,0:48:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.09,0:48:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我带你四处看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let me show you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.21,0:48:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.31,0:48:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,从他们的外表看来 十元赌他们来自洛杉矶\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the look of them, I'll bet $10 they're from Los Angeles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.89,0:48:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,痞子 别档路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you hippies, get your butts off the road!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.13,0:48:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢那颗闪亮的红灯 就如同氪星的太阳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like the globe. It flashes red like our Krypton sun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.63,0:49:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不喜欢那恼人的噪音\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not this irritating noise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.50,0:49:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.17,0:49:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听对了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I hear right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.14,0:49:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个混球对我下命令？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That son of a bitch give me an order?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.48,0:49:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜安 让你来处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Duane, you take care of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.52,0:49:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你以为你在做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just what in the hell do you think you're doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.45,0:49:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么标志？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this symbol?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.65,0:49:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你追随其他颌导人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you follow another leader?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.62,0:49:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,追随领导人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow the leader?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.13,0:49:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,痛死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy skunk sweat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.66,0:49:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧… - 这是什么武器？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. - A weapon of some sort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.71,0:49:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么办到的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the hell did you do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.05,0:49:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的老天爷啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus H. Christ.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.05,0:49:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那样很好 - 我想或许我们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That was good. - I thought we might…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.89,0:50:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次能够省咯橘子汁\N{\fnArial\fs30}…abandon the orange juice for once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.90,0:50:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 干杯 - 干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here, cheers. - Cheers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.88,0:50:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,扮演克拉克肯特很辛苦吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be tough being Clark Kent, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.35,0:50:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, I really…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.25,0:50:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时我还蛮喜欢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really like it sometimes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.58,0:50:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我是在愚弄自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even though I do make a fool of myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.42,0:50:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果不是因为他… 我就不会认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, you know, if it weren't for him, I never would have met you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.76,0:50:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但…他就是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he is you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.00,0:50:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真让人搞不清楚 - 对我而言并不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's kind of confusing. - Not to me, it isn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.70,0:50:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.94,0:50:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到昨天 我们一直遗忘 这座中部的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until yesterday, a middle-American town that Middle America had forgotten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.86,0:51:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,中型美国市镇 现在人口已达123人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But today, the population…Exaggerated reports put it at 123.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.53,0:51:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为增加了3个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}has increased by three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.17,0:51:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这三名新来的人马上带来毁坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}And these three new arrivalsbring destruction in their wake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.06,0:51:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天早上我向东休士顿看去\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I look west into East Houston this morning…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.26,0:51:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这座小镇充满了恐惧 - 那是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …I see a town gripped with fear. - Who's the guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.64,0:51:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓那个人 跟住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get that guy. Follow the guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.28,0:51:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个大个子是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's the big guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.95,0:51:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我们遇上…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, yeah, we've got a…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.24,0:51:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 知道吗？ - 不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got that? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.24,0:51:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没问题 - 试着前复摆动一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's fine. - Try to wiggle it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.21,0:51:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,有哪些人能看到？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who else is seeing this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.31,0:51:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,利用卫星连线 全世界所有人都能看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, with this satellite linkup, just about everybody. The whole planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.32,0:51:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个休士顿星吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole planet Houston?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.72,0:51:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是地球 整个地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earth. The whole planet Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.39,0:51:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以继续转播\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may continue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.63,0:51:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,随着这桩意外事件的发展\N{\fnArial\fs30}As the extraordinary story continues…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.23,0:51:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 随着这桩意外事件… - 这男人够了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Enough of this man. - As this extraordinary…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.50,0:51:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果全世界都在收看 能否让他们看些有趣画面？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the whole planet is watching, let's show them something interesting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.14,0:51:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,把武器放下投降\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throw down your arms and surrender!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.44,0:51:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is an order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.95,0:52:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,查德将军不接受命令 他是下命令的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}General Zod does not take orders. He gives them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.87,0:52:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就在火线上 但是却毫发无损\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was in the line of that fire and nothing happened to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.98,0:52:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有看过这种事 除了超人之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't seen the likes of this since Superman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.21,0:52:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes? Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.15,0:52:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制室已经通知我 有一队 武装直升机已经上路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The News beat control room has informed me that a fleet of helicopter gunships is…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.05,0:52:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 总统先生 难道我们不能… - 恐怕没有人有办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr. President, sir, can't we… - There's nothing anybody can do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.72,0:52:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们拥有强大的力量 什么都阻档不了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have such powers, nothing can stop them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.23,0:52:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,超人在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Superman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.83,0:52:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪里？ 为什么他不想想办法？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?Why doesn't he do something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.31,0:53:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,再发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.81,0:53:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,再发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.52,0:53:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 他们要利用机器才能飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. They need machines to fly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.75,0:53:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 降落了 - 真是英勇啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Banking now. - What bravery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.76,0:53:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,对他们好一点 送他们个飞吻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be nice to them, my dear.Blow them a kiss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.66,0:53:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,火箭准备就绪 瞄准目标中 等等…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rockets ready. Coming in on target.Wait, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.50,0:53:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要下坠了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're out of control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.77,0:53:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要坠机了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're coming in, coming down.Can't control it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.19,0:53:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要坠机了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're coming down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.55,0:53:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I win.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.85,0:53:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我每次都会赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always win.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.09,0:53:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,全地球没有人敢向我挑战吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there no one on this planet to even challenge me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.41,0:54:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come forward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.22,0:54:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,将军阁下有话要说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your general wishes to speak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.38,0:54:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是查德将军 你们的统治者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am General Zod, your ruler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.96,0:54:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 今天以新的命令开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, today begins a new order!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.26,0:54:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的土地 财产和生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your lands, your possessions…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.90,0:54:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部都要献给我 查德将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}…your very lives will gladly be given in tribute to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.40,0:54:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了回报你们的服从…\N{\fnArial\fs30}In return for your obedience…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.74,0:54:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们将享有我慷慨的保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you will enjoy my generous protection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.57,0:54:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,换官之 我允许你们活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}In other words, you will be allowed to live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.95,0:54:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是名将军…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you are a general?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.98,0:54:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是你的上级长官？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who is your superior?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.92,0:55:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我只对总统负责 - 而他将对我负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I answer only to the president. - And he will answer to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.33,0:55:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则所有城市的下场 都将像这座小镇一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or all of his cities will end up like this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.14,0:55:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,花了数千小时才创造完成 几秒钟之内就已模糊不清\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thousands of hours to create, and they defaced it in seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.94,0:55:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们反抗 想想看他们会怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine what they'll do to the world if we resist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.98,0:55:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的星球的人对你很满意 凯尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}The people of your planet are well-pleased with you, Kal-El.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.48,0:55:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你竭诚为他们服务 他们也很威激\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have served them faithfully, and they are grateful for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.12,0:55:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你居然又回来与我理论\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet you have returned to reason with me once again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.63,0:55:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿子 我一直尝试 预测你所有的问题 卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son, I have tried to anticipate your every question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.73,0:55:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我连想都没…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was one I'd…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.04,0:55:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你不会问到这个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd hoped you would not ask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.14,0:55:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的情感…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My attachment…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.15,0:55:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对某位人类发展出的情悻\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the feelings which I have developed for a certain human being…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.75,0:56:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,已深深影响我 父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}…have deeply affected me, Father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.25,0:56:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你投注原本该给所有人的时间与情感\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot serve humanity by investing your time and emotion in one human being…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.93,0:56:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一个人身上 便无法服务全人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}…at the expense of the rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.28,0:56:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这两件事互不相容 - 那么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The concepts are mutually exclusive. - And…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.68,0:56:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,若我再也不愿为全人类服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}…if I no longer wishto serve humanity…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.80,0:56:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要这样回报他们的感激吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this how you repay their gratitude?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.58,0:56:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,丢下弱小的 无法自我保护的 有需要的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}By abandoning the weak, the defenseless, the needy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.55,0:56:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,只为了你自私的追求？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for the sake of your selfish pursuits?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.38,0:56:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,自私？在我为他们做了那么多之后？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Selfish? After all I've done for them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.95,0:56:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的服务 会有功德圆满的一天吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will there ever come a time when I've served enough?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.76,0:56:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少他们有幸福的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least they get a chance for happiness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.46,0:56:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也只要幸福 不需要更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only ask as much, no more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.86,0:56:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的幸福层次更高\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yours is a higher happiness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.73,0:56:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定有感觉到 完成使命的鼓舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fulfillment of your mission, an inspiration you must have felt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.70,0:56:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你心里一定体会过那种幸福\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must have felt that happiness within you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.94,0:56:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿子 你无法否定那种感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son, surely you cannot deny that feeling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.44,0:57:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我的确不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I cannot…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.48,0:57:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也无法否定另外这股 更强的威觉 父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}…any more than I can deny the other, which is stronger in me, Father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.75,0:57:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,它强烈的多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much stronger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.99,0:57:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的没有办法吗 父亲？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there no way then, Father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.76,0:57:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道我将得不到 生命中唯一真正渴望之物？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must I finally be denied the one thing in life which I truly desire?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.40,0:57:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你不是凯尔…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you will not be Kal-El…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.57,0:57:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你是他们的一员…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…if you will live as one of them…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.07,0:57:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,并如此爱他们的一员…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…love their kind as one of them…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.64,0:57:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须变成\N{\fnArial\fs30}…then it follows that you must…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.51,0:57:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个普通人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…become one of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.14,0:58:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这座水晶舱中充满氪星的太阳光\N{\fnArial\fs30}This crystal chamber has in it the harnessed rays of the red sun of Krypton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.48,0:58:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦受到这些光线曝晒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once exposed to them…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.05,0:58:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在地球上所有的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}…all your great power son Earth will disappear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.52,0:58:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,都将永远消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.69,0:58:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为一旦做了将无法回头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once this is done, there's no going back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.20,0:58:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会感觉像个普通人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will feel like an ordinary man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.63,0:58:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,也会像普通人一样受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you can be harmed like an ordinary man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.90,0:58:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,三思啊 凯尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think, Kal-El.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.21,0:58:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我求求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I beg you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.91,0:58:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.81,0:58:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱她\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I love her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.10,0:59:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,要三思 凯尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think, Kal-El.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.38,1:01:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.96,1:01:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.38,1:02:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是他们称为总统的人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the one they call president?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.05,1:02:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.75,1:02:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为你很崇敬飞行物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you are practiced in worshipping things that fly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.96,1:02:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.56,1:02:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,在查德面前不能坐着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rise before Zod.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.70,1:02:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在到查德面前跪下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, kneel before Zod.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.89,1:02:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是总统\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not the president.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.72,1:02:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个统治那么多人的人 不会那么快就下跪\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one who leads so many could possibly kneel so quickly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.66,1:02:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是他们保护的对象\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the man they are protecting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.80,1:02:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是总统\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the president.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.60,1:02:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果能救大家的命 我愿下跪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll kneel before you if it will save lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.27,1:02:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.17,1:03:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,从救你自己的命开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starting with your own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.44,1:03:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这肯定是个落后的星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a backward planet this must be…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.08,1:03:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,男人们穿戴缎带\N{\fnArial\fs30}…where the men wear the ribbons…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.45,1:03:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,与珠宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and the jewelry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.53,1:03:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I do now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.60,1:03:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是为了全球人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I do for the sake of the people of the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.97,1:03:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但地球上还有一个人 绝不会向你下跪\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there is one man here on Earth who will never kneel before you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.27,1:03:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个笨蛋是谁？他在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this imbecile? Where is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.71,1:03:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I knew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.05,1:03:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.89,1:03:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,查德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zod.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.06,1:03:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.69,1:03:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的很安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're awfully quiet over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.46,1:04:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我正在想…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I was just thinking…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.40,1:04:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信你竟会为我放弃一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I can't believe what you've given up for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.74,1:04:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在闲玩笑？那么做不仅为你 露易丝 我是为了我们而做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding? I didn't do it for you, Lois, I did it for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.87,1:04:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你附近有家热狗店\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I told you there'd be a hot dog place somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.08,1:04:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 因为你不能飞 所以得花多一点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. It sure takes longer when you can't fly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.22,1:04:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,快一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.08,1:04:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.22,1:04:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我请客\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, it's my treat. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.26,1:04:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 是完美先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, boy, it's Mr. Wonderful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.27,1:04:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦？谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.77,1:04:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请问有男厕所吗？ - 此在转角\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you have a men's room? - Yeah. Right in the corner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.71,1:04:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 想要坐下吗？ - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Want to sit down? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.21,1:04:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想吃点什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, what would you folks like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.88,1:04:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要一套总汇起士汉堡 和一杯可乐…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like a cheeseburger with everything on it, and a Coke…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.62,1:04:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要一份薯条及一份沙拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}…an order of fries and a side salad, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.35,1:04:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你呢？先生 - 等我回来再点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And for you, sir? - I'll think about it when I get back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.52,1:05:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 总汇起士汉堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. That's one cheeseburger…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.29,1:05:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 牛排加蛋 只煎单面 咖啡 - 我的可乐 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Steak and eggs, over easy, coffee. - Can I have my Coke?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.13,1:05:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming right up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.26,1:05:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 这个位子有人坐 - 正是现在 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry, that seat's taken. - It is now, sweetheart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.90,1:05:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能请你吃东西吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I buy you something to eat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.54,1:05:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.14,1:05:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 你坐了我的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. I think you're sitting in my seat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.28,1:05:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的位置在那边 四眼田鸡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your seat's in there, four-eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.78,1:05:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许该有人教教你礼貌 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gee, I think perhaps somebody ought to teach you some manners, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.79,1:05:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？等他来了再告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Well, let me know when he comes in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.46,1:05:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们只是想… - 亲爱的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, Clark, we can just… - Honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.26,1:05:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 先生 你愿意到外面去吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, sir, would you care to step outside?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.83,1:05:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说 请问先生 你愿意到外面去吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, excuse me, sir, would you care to step outside?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.84,1:05:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 你的牛排马上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, listen, Rocky, your steak's coming right up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.17,1:05:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,让它在炉上热着 这件事只需要一分钟就解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it on the flame, Ron.This is just a minute steak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.18,1:05:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先请\N{\fnArial\fs30}After you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.41,1:05:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 克拉克 - 没关系的 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Clark. - It's all right, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.59,1:06:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,克拉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clark!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.86,1:06:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right, fella?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.49,1:06:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会没事的 把毛巾给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna be fine, just give me that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.59,1:06:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 克拉克？ - 血 是我的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Clark?- Blood. It's my blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.96,1:06:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想… 或许从现在起 你该雇个保镖\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think maybe we ought to hire a bodyguard from now on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.34,1:06:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要保镖 我要我爱上的那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want a bodyguard.I want the man I fell in love with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.97,1:06:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 露易丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that, Lois.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.27,1:06:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望他在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish he were here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.18,1:06:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,克拉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.29,1:06:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 你还不打算罢手吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, you just don't have enough sense to stay down, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.50,1:06:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…不是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You… You… You are no good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.40,1:06:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Settle down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.20,1:06:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正我不喜欢你的肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like your meat anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.81,1:06:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.75,1:07:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,克拉克？…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clark? Clark?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.89,1:07:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你站得起来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clark, can you get up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.89,1:07:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事的 我来扶你 - 慢慢来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. Come on. I got you. - Go slow. Go slow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.76,1:07:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,试着坐到椅子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try and get up in that chair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.36,1:07:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 坐下 - 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sit down. - I'm all right. I'm all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.43,1:07:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没事 大家放轻松 我们还有些新煮的咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, everybody, he's all right.Just relax. We'll have some fresh coffee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.24,1:07:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把电视打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll turn the box on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.37,1:07:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,本台节目暂时中断 播报一则紧急消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}We interrupt this program for an urgent message…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.38,1:07:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,由美国总统宣布\N{\fnArial\fs30}…from the President of the United States.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.51,1:07:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是美国总统\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your president.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.12,1:07:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我代表美国 和世上其他领袖之名\N{\fnArial\fs30}On behalf of my country, and in the name of the other leaders of the world…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.45,1:07:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及今天我所咨询过的相关人员\N{\fnArial\fs30}…with whom I have today consulted…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.72,1:07:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在此宣布放弃…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I hereby abdicate…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.73,1:07:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我所有的权力 以及地球的控制权\N{\fnArial\fs30}…all authority and control over this planet…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.53,1:07:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,让予查德将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to General Zod.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.87,1:07:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,查德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zod.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.24,1:08:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯有完全听从 他的命令才能活命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only by strict compliance with all his directions…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.57,1:08:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,才得以拯救千百万无辜性命\N{\fnArial\fs30}…will the lives of innocent millions be spared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.08,1:08:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,超人 你听到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Superman, can you hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.81,1:08:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 超人 你到底在哪… - 谁是超人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Superman, where? - Who is this Superman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.78,1:08:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会知道的 到时候…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll find out. And when you do…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.35,1:08:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,来找我 超人 如果你敢的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come to me, Superman, if you dare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.99,1:08:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你中挑战\N{\fnArial\fs30}I defy you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.79,1:08:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 到查德面前下跪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come! Come and kneel before Zod.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.66,1:08:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,查德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zod!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.67,1:08:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这里？什么时候？ - 什么时候？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here? When? - When?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.64,1:08:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你上哪儿去了？ 废弃的荒岛吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell have you been, Mac? On a desert island?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.14,1:08:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to go back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.01,1:08:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't go back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.18,1:08:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在已经没办法了 - 我必须去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's no way now. - I have to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.85,1:08:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定要试试看 该死 我什么办法都要试\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've gotta try, damn it. I've gotta try something, anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.25,1:08:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是你的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not your fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.29,1:08:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道会发生这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't know this was gonna happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.09,1:08:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.10,1:08:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到他说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.53,1:09:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我却不在意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just didn't listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.45,1:09:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的调查都由你主导\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're master of all you survey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.22,1:09:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我昨天也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so I was yesterday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.35,1:09:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有前天也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the day before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.80,1:09:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 你们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.57,1:09:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是雷克斯路瑟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lex Luthor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.88,1:09:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是雷克斯路瑟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lex Luthor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.48,1:09:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你们听过这个名字 我是地球上最伟大的罪犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've heard the name? The greatest criminal mind on Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.92,1:09:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你这只是个小星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you this was a puny planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.72,1:09:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,请等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait just a moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.52,1:10:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你们更了解我再说好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait until you get to know me better. Will you, please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.83,1:10:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你们想要什么 我都能提供\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Look, I can give you anything you want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.70,1:10:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以给你勇气 让你们有无限自由去残害…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can give you the brass ring…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.86,1:10:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀戮和毁灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the unlimited freedom to maim, kill, destroy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.10,1:10:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,加上雷克斯路瑟敏锐的心灵 雷克斯路瑟的见解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus, Lex Luthor's keen mind.Lex Luthor's savvy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.87,1:10:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷克斯路瑟是生涯导师 雷克斯路瑟是优质教师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lex Luthor's career guidance.Lex Luthor's School of Better…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.11,1:10:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用你 我们这些早就有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have all of this without you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.38,1:10:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能用我们已有的东西协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot bargain with what you don't have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.25,1:10:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,至尊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magnificent One…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.39,1:10:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要用你没有的来协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}…what I am bargaining with is what you do not have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.96,1:10:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔尔的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The son of Jor-El.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.13,1:10:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔尔的儿子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The son of Jor-El?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.80,1:10:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是这么说的 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said that, didn't I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.80,1:10:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,囚禁我们的乔尔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jor-El, our jailer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.71,1:10:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 是棒球选手乔尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Jor-El, the baseball player.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.04,1:10:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啦 囚禁你们的乔尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Jor-El, your jailer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.31,1:10:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 乔尔的儿子？他在地球？ - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The son of Jor-El? On this planet? - Aye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.98,1:10:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你们比较熟悉他的化名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possibly you know him better by his nom de voyage…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.78,1:11:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是他用旅行用的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}…or his name he travels under:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.05,1:11:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Superman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.16,1:11:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来是超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is Superman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.13,1:11:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么认识乔尔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know of Jor-El?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.63,1:11:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是全心全意的 正如我先前向你解释的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Fullness, as I explained to you before…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.07,1:11:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是地球上最棒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I'm about the best there is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.80,1:11:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Revenge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.27,1:11:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将杀了狱卒的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will kill the son of our jailer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.44,1:11:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 复仇 - 复仇 我们正在进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Revenge. - Revenge! Now we're cooking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.61,1:11:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他会飞吗？ - 经常飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He flies, then? - Constantly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.78,1:11:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他的力量跟我们一样吗？ - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He has powers as we do? - Certainly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.98,1:11:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是… 至尊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Magnificent One…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.49,1:11:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只有一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…he's just one…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.49,1:11:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你们有三个\N{\fnArial\fs30}…where you are three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.79,1:11:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果你把他算两次 就有四个 - 我们会让他下跪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Or four, if you count him twice. - We will bring him to his knees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.46,1:11:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.70,1:11:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们得先找到他才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, you must find him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.27,1:11:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯有雷克斯宝贝知道他在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Lex Baby is the only one who knows where he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.11,1:11:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你… 想要什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.81,1:11:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,将军…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, general…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.11,1:12:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个是个广大的星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the world is a big place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.85,1:12:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢上帝…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank goodness…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.45,1:12:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的需求很小\N{\fnArial\fs30}…my needs are small.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.85,1:12:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,海景的资产对我特别有吸引力\N{\fnArial\fs30}As it turns out, I have this affinity for beach front property.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.39,1:12:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…想要什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.06,1:12:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要澳洲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Australia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.40,1:12:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.67,1:13:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 拜托 你去…？ 请停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen… Hey, come on, where are you… Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.71,1:13:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.91,1:13:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你听得到我的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you can hear me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.65,1:13:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I failed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.99,1:13:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让你失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I failed you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.16,1:13:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让自己失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I failed myself…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.83,1:13:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,也让全人类失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and all humanity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.83,1:14:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用与生俱来的权利…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've traded my birthright…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.10,1:14:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,在由你的敌人统治的世界里 换取屈从的一生\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for a life of submission in a world that's now ruled by your enemies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.61,1:14:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经没有人能帮助…\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nobody left to help them now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.91,1:14:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个世界的人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the people of the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.91,1:14:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少在我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not since I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.85,1:14:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.06,1:15:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好听着 吾儿 这将是我们最后一次谈话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen carefully, my son, for we shall never speak again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.53,1:15:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你现在听得到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you hear me now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.27,1:15:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你便使用到仅剩的能力之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}…then you have made use of the only means left to you:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.24,1:15:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,便是让我们开始沟通的水晶源头\N{\fnArial\fs30}The crystal source through which our communications begun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.11,1:15:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个过程已经完整\N{\fnArial\fs30}The circle is now complete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.91,1:15:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯尔 你犯了极大的罪过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have made a dreadful mistake, Kal-El.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.52,1:16:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以自由意志决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did this of your own free will…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.59,1:16:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,枉我尽一切所能想说服你\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in spite of all I could say to dissuade you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.69,1:16:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.46,1:16:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你回到我面前 最后一次试着证明自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you have returned to me for one last chance to redeem yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.13,1:16:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这部分最后我也预料到了 吾儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}This too finally I have anticipated, my son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.71,1:16:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我 凯尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me, Kal-El.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.31,1:16:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你小时候 我曾死过一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once before when you were small, I died…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.15,1:16:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是为了给你生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}…while giving you a chance for life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.26,1:16:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 虽然这将用尽 我体内最后的能量…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, even though it will exhaust the final energy left within me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.93,1:16:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.26,1:16:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我 凯尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me, Kal-El.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.47,1:16:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,氪星的预官终于将被实现\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Kryptonian prophecy will be at last fulfilled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.58,1:17:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿子变成父亲 父亲化为儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The son becomes the father, the father becomes the son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.62,1:17:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,永别了 凯尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Farewell forever, Kal-El.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.79,1:17:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,要记得我 吾儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember me, my son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.29,1:17:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,吾儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.48,1:18:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.82,1:18:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈洛 黑咖啡 不加糖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harold. Coffee, black, no sugar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.43,1:18:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑咖啡 不加…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Black, no sug… Yeah. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.43,1:18:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁付钱啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's paying, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.03,1:18:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那里有三个人 有荒谬的将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no! There's three of them.That cockamamie general…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.94,1:18:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,一辆长头发的大卡车 和像伸展台皇后的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and a big truck with hair on it and a broad that looks like the queen of the runway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.24,1:18:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们能飞 能透视 超人能做的 他们都办得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can fly, they can see through things.Anything Superman can do, they can do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.45,1:18:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他人呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he, anyway?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.95,1:18:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他还没有听到消息 老编\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he hasn't heard about it yet, chief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.12,1:18:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 或许… - 或许他的胆量用完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe… - Maybe he's just run out of guts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.45,1:18:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不加糖 而且别叫我老编 - 他会来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No sugar. And don't call me "chief." - He'll be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.26,1:18:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果他有办法他一定会来的 - 没错 他一定会来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If there's any way at all, he'll be here. - Yeah, he'll be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.30,1:19:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在怎么样了？ - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's going on? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.30,1:19:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你感觉到了吗 查理？ - 有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Charlie, you feel that? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.47,1:19:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉好像地震\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like an earthquake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.97,1:19:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.65,1:19:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 正是那三个 - 停\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's those three. - Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.48,1:19:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 他们已经来了 - 不好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my God, they're here now! - Oh, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.40,1:19:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好恐怖\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is scary!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.71,1:20:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？老编\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right, chief?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.35,1:20:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.55,1:20:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们该看看白宫 得好几个月才能清干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should see the White House.They'll be cleaning for months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.72,1:20:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是雷克斯路瑟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lex Luthor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.66,1:20:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你猜不到吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't you know it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.53,1:20:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是乔尔的儿子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the son of Jor-El?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.40,1:20:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 但你一定是个… - 吉姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, but I bet you're a son of a… - Jimmy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.67,1:20:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你答应给我乔尔的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You promised me the son of Jor-El.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.14,1:20:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Your Grace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.91,1:20:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是… 我所给你的是次好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what I've given you is the next best thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.68,1:20:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住那位小姐… 他一定会来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just hold on to that little lady, and he'll be along.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.85,1:20:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有这种特殊关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, they have this relationship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.58,1:21:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,她替他做公共关系 而他给她所有独家新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}She does all his public relations, and he gives her every exclusive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.09,1:21:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是最好的朋友 了解我的意思吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're the best of friends.You know what I mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.09,1:21:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个超人还真随便\N{\fnArial\fs30}What an undemanding male this Superman must be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.76,1:21:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也需要改进一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could use a tuck here and there yourself, sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.93,1:21:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.70,1:21:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 她暂时可以活命\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry! - She lives for now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.00,1:21:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,把其他人都杀了 就从他开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill the rest, starting with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.90,1:21:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Wait, wait, wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.57,1:21:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.27,1:21:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得白宫吗？椭圆形办公室 我们曾有过欢笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you remember the White House?The Oval Room? We had a few laughs there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.95,1:21:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们一定要改一改\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ought to have that fixed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.13,1:21:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}General…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.23,1:21:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没听过媒体言论自由吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…haven't you heard of freedom of the press?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.56,1:21:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 超人 - 感谢老天 是超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Superman! - Superman, thank God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.57,1:21:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫你去抓他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, get him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.30,1:21:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,到我面前来 乔尔之子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come to me, son of Jor-El!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.64,1:21:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,到查德面前下跪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kneel before Zod!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.12,1:22:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out. You all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.68,1:22:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔尔之子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of Jor-El.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.75,1:22:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们开始以为你是个懦夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were beginning to think you were a coward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.68,1:22:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是懦夫 查德\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a coward, Zod.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.18,1:22:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你八成只是个笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is extremely likely you are merely a fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.45,1:22:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,有其父必有其子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like father, like son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.10,1:23:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.54,1:23:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该死就得死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then die as you deserve to!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.49,1:23:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 抓住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on, Superman! Get him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.96,1:23:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, this is gonna be good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.03,1:24:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Superman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.62,1:24:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是老编的 - 老编已经有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, that's the chief's. - The chief's got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.73,1:24:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你打了女人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you hit a woman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.82,1:25:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 我的小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God! My baby!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.33,1:25:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我的宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help my baby!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.66,1:25:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦？谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.93,1:25:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个超人没什么了不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}This Superman is nothing of the kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.67,1:25:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我已经发现他的弱点了 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I've discovered his weakness. - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.27,1:25:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他关心\N{\fnArial\fs30}He cares.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.94,1:25:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真的很关心地球人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He actually cares for these Earth people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.35,1:25:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 此像宠物一样？ - 我想是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like pets? - I suppose so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.69,1:25:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来分散他的注意力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll draw his fire…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.79,1:25:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,用我自己的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}…with some of my own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.29,1:26:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些车子怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening to those cars?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.39,1:26:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,别挡路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of the way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.04,1:27:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Superman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.68,1:28:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.25,1:28:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没想到这事会持续这么久\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never thought this thing would go the distance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.03,1:28:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 别动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Don't do it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.54,1:28:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,车上的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The people!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.88,1:28:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,扔啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throw it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.90,1:29:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别靠近那里 远离那个地方 - 我们快去帮他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get away from there. Get away from there. - Let's help them out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.74,1:29:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别担心 我去救她 - 他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got her. I got her. Don't worry. - He's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.85,1:29:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,超人死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Superman is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.08,1:29:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们杀了超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've killed Superman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.82,1:29:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他死了 - 我们去找他们报仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's dead. - Let's go get them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.26,1:29:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来 让他们知道我们的厉害 - 我会空手道 上啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, we'll show them! - I know some judo. Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.43,1:29:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.39,1:30:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓住了 我抓住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm holding it, I'm holding it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.19,1:30:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都看不到能做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can you do if you can't see what's happening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.57,1:30:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抓稳了 - 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hold on! - Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.61,1:31:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能丢下我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't leave us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.78,1:31:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 他毕竟是个懦夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he is a coward after all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.48,1:31:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.19,1:31:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来 超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back, Superman!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.79,1:31:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,别丢下我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't leave us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.36,1:31:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他临阵逃脱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He chickened out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.87,1:31:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,骗子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phony!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.24,1:31:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,超人 什么都没做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Superman didn't even do nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.47,1:31:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.58,1:32:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们在那儿 - 快走开 吉姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There they are. - Get away from here. Jimmy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.43,1:32:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经战胜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our victory is complete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.43,1:32:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔尔之子逃跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The son of Jor-El has fled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.36,1:32:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 超人跑掉了？ - 我不相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Superman fled? - I don't believe you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.23,1:32:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到了 三对一 你大获全胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard him. Three against one, you should've taken two ears and a tail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.44,1:32:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他被我们吓走了 - 他会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He fled in fear of us. - He'll be back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.74,1:32:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要他还活着 就会再试一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as he's alive, he's gonna try again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.28,1:32:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 下一次 我们会杀了他 - 下一次？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The next time, we will kill him. - The next time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.75,1:32:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一次？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The next time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.55,1:32:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该拿你们怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I gonna do with you people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.79,1:32:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里等着超人出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}I held up my end.I delivered you the blue boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.59,1:32:47.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们三位要如何回报我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do I get from my triple threat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.06,1:32:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,「鞠躬 屈膝 下跪」 这种事在这里不管用\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Bow, yield, kneel."That kind of stuff closes out a town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.96,1:32:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么这样对我说话？ 你明知我可以因此而杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you say this to me when you know I will kill you for it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.97,1:33:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀我？雷克斯路瑟？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill me? Lex Luthor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.21,1:33:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀掉本世代最伟大的罪犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Extinguish the greatest criminal flame of our age?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.14,1:33:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杀掉地球上唯一… - 杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Eradicate the only man on earth with… - Let me kill him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.75,1:33:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,超人的地址？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Superman's address?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.22,1:33:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还要什么？ 我看到你脸上写满贪婪\N{\fnArial\fs30}What more do you want?I can see the greed written on your face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.72,1:33:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个小奖励 最棒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A small incentive, O Fullest One.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.76,1:33:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,一样挑起回忆的小东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}A mere bauble to jog the memory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.40,1:33:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What more?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.57,1:33:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,古巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cuba.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.78,1:33:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷克斯路瑟 希望你不是在浪费我的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust you are not wasting my time, Lex Luthor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.18,1:33:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不是 难搞的大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course not, Your Turbulence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.63,1:34:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,现身吧 懦夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show yourself, coward!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.64,1:34:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,懦夫的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a coward!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.21,1:34:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里 查德\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here, Zod.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.85,1:34:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放莲恩小姐走 我们到里面谈谈 - 不要 超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let Miss Lane go, step inside. We'll talk. - No, don't, Superman!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.08,1:34:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,别听他的 他只是个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't listen to him. He's just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.52,1:34:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,停手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.92,1:34:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的能力与我的相同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your powers are identical to mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.09,1:35:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们有三个人 可以把你五马分尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we are three.We could tear you limb from limb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.66,1:35:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,下手吧 将军大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it, Your Grace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.26,1:35:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱只腿 许个愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just grab a leg and just make a wish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.93,1:35:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你是另一项致命弱点的受害者\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you are victim to another fatal weakness…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.77,1:35:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你的同情心\N{\fnArial\fs30}…your compassion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.23,1:35:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你来说 他人的死比你自己的更重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}The death of others means more to you than your own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.00,1:35:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 但偶有例外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, with rare exceptions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.91,1:35:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲让我们进人间炼狱永不得翻身 你的命运也将相同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father condemned us to an eternal living death. Your fate will be the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.71,1:35:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯尔 你将永远活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will live, Kal-El, forever…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.95,1:35:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,做我的奴隶 否则他人将为你的固执付出代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}…as my slave. If not, then other swill pay for your obstinate attitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.12,1:35:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,无辜的人 必要时可达上百万 就从这位露易丝开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Innocent people, millions if necessary, beginning with this Lois person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.79,1:35:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 超人 不要 - 停手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't, Superman, don't! - Stop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.63,1:35:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 查德\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Zod.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.57,1:35:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.87,1:35:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,将军大人 别相信他 你不像我如此了解他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Grace, don't believe him!You don't know him the way that I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.81,1:35:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉到乔尔在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sense the presence of Jor-El here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.98,1:35:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会毁了这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will destroy this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.38,1:36:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,然复杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then kill him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.09,1:36:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.12,1:36:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他还是我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Him? Me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.46,1:36:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,将军大人 我是雷克斯路瑟\N{\fnArial\fs30}General, this is Lex Luthor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.06,1:36:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得吗？在你失意时我帮过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember? I helped you through the tough times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.80,1:36:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让你充满力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}I filled your inside straight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.17,1:36:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,当初你双手空空来找我 而我给了你超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You came to me with nothing.I gave you Superman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.44,1:36:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silence!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.08,1:36:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.18,1:36:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙真的很笨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guy's a clod.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.32,1:36:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还以为了解人们 是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you know people, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.98,1:36:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,协议已经达成 也交换了礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promises were made, gifts were exchanged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.29,1:36:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须信任你 你说的都是实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta hand it to you, you know.You always told the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.86,1:36:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很清楚谁跟你是同一阵线\N{\fnArial\fs30}A guy always knew where he stood with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.80,1:36:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,试着把他们骗进这个分子室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try to get them all into this molecule chamber here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.83,1:36:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会夺走他们的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}It takes away their powers, see…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.14,1:36:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,使他们成为平凡的人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and turns them into ordinary human beings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.87,1:36:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你能够…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if you could…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.28,1:37:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要进去 那是个陷阱 - 你这个狡猾的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't go in there. It's a trap. - Luthor, you poisonous snake!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.85,1:37:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个分子室\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a molecule chamber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.55,1:37:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会把你们变成跟我一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It makes people like you into people like me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.82,1:37:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你做的很好 雷克斯路瑟 - 我也这么觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You've done well, Lex Luthor. - I thought so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.22,1:37:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seize him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.49,1:37:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杀了她 - 不要 超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kill her. - No! Superman, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.79,1:37:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 查德 别伤害她\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right! All right, leave her alone, Zod!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.46,1:37:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You win.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.34,1:37:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那颗水晶能够启动机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}General, the crystal there activates the mechanism.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.07,1:37:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷克斯路瑟 澳洲统治者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lex Luthor, ruler of Australia…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.08,1:37:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,去启动机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}…activate the machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.92,1:37:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你允许\N{\fnArial\fs30}With your permission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.10,1:39:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在终于…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, finally…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.17,1:39:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,跪下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kneel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.34,1:39:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,握着我的手…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take my hand…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.95,1:39:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,发誓永远效忠查德\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and swear eternal loyalty to Zod.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.79,1:40:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他转换了机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}He switched it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.79,1:40:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他将他们变弱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did it to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.46,1:40:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说光线在外面 而他在里面很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lights were on out here while he was safe in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.24,1:40:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you know something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.57,1:40:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的是个讨厌鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a real pain in the neck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.65,1:40:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.52,1:40:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你会反叛我 狡猾的你忍不住会说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you'd double-cross me, Luthor.A lying weasel like you couldn't resist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.83,1:40:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在开玩笑吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who, me? Are you kidding?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.86,1:40:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直是跟你同阵线 真的好美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I was with you all the time. That was beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.10,1:40:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到他们掉入陷阱的样子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see the way they fell into our trap?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.50,1:40:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,太迟了 太迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too late, Luthor. Too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.20,1:40:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 是超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. Look, Superman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.84,1:40:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a proposition for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.94,1:40:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要阻止我 直到你听说这个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, don't stop me till you've heard this…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.44,1:40:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我还欠你一次 但我们还在北极 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…because I know I owe you one, but we're in the North Pole, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.96,1:42:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 露易丝…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Lois…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:18.66,1:42:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不后悔 好吗？ 我做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No regrets, okay? I did it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.13,1:42:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让我爱的男人爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got the man I loved to love me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.64,1:42:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不对？ - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Didn't I? - Oh, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:32.48,1:42:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 此这样 那些人需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, okay then. Those people need you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.38,1:42:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我不懂吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think I don't understand that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.22,1:42:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 我们依然可以见面 常常见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can still see each other, you know.I mean, all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.03,1:42:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但就是不能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it just can't be…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.75,1:43:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要别忘记就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just don't forget, that's all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.82,1:43:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远别忘记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't ever forget.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.68,1:43:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们到了 - 甜蜜的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, here we are. - Home sweet home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.05,1:43:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早上在办公室见 - 朝气蓬勃 是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- See you at work in the morning. - Bright and early, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.69,1:43:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 原来的克拉克与原来的露易丝 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The same old Clark and the same old Lois. - Yup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.39,1:44:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过… 或许以后我会对你好一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except… maybe I won't be quite so mean to you from now on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:08.10,1:44:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.94,1:44:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会保守你的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your secrets safe with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.81,1:44:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 露易丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I know that, Lois.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.60,1:44:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他走了 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there he goes, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.94,1:44:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,在天空飞翔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up, up and away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.36,1:46:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要 - 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.84,1:46:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 白先生有空吗？ - 他正在讲电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, is Mr. White free? - On the telephone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.20,1:46:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他现在正在开会 - 对 这是他的说辞\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's in conference at the moment. - Yeah, that's what he says.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.11,1:47:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 给我三份副本\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, give me three carbons of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.51,1:47:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 这将是报纸中的夹页\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi. - It's gonna be an insert in the paper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:09.85,1:47:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是这么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what they said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:13.26,1:47:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning. Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:21.40,1:47:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安 露易丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, Lois.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:28.74,1:47:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早安 露易丝 - 你好 克拉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good morning, Lois. - Hi, Clark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.74,1:47:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 我看过不少人做白日梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeepers, I have seen some faraway looks in my time…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:33.64,1:47:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你这副德行 大概已飘到北极去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but with that look, you might as wellbe on the North Pole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:37.85,1:47:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,北极\N{\fnArial\fs30}The North Pole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:41.25,1:47:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那太傻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's too silly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:43.82,1:47:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是否曾经觉得 你知道很重要的事 你得…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you ever feel like you knew something that was so important that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.28,1:47:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你从来没有过\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you never did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:51.95,1:47:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 我觉得手上有 整个生涯最重要的新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I feel like I'm sitting on the singlemost important story of my career…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.27,1:48:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,却记不得那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and I can't remember what it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.87,1:48:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,以我对你的了解 那一定跟超人有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, knowing you, it must have been about Superman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.67,1:48:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是他如何拯救这座城市 拯救地球 或拯救宇宙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe how he saved the city or saved the world or saved the universe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:08.11,1:48:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,克拉克… 听我说 忌妒会让生产力下降\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clark, Clark. Listen.Jealousy's really counter productive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.21,1:48:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也可以做点别的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, there's some things that you can do too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.88,1:48:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:17.69,1:48:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? Like what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.66,1:48:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我们叫彼萨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get us a pizza.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.89,1:48:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在要叫彼萨？ - 对 我饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A pizza. Now? - Yeah, I'm hungry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:28.13,1:48:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 我想白先生要是发现 不会太高兴…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, I don't think Mr. White would like it if…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:30.83,1:48:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我出一半钱 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll pay for half of it, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:32.97,1:48:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:39.54,1:48:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,露易丝？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lois?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:41.48,1:48:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 彼萨的事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, about the pizza?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:44.01,1:48:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 我请客\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. I'll pay for the whole thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.65,1:48:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 你人最好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you're really super.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:13.34,1:49:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 朗 - 什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Ron. - Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.91,1:49:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,再给我一盘这种垃圾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me another plate of this garbage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.88,1:49:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,垃圾？这是最受欢迎的特餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Garbage? That's my number-one special, Rocky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:20.85,1:49:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 再多给我一些咖啡好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Get me some more coffee too, will you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:25.68,1:49:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 真有趣 我没看过垃圾在吃垃圾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gee, that's funny. I've neverseen garbage eat garbage before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:38.20,1:49:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 先生 你坐了我最爱的位子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, sir. I think you're sitting in my favorite seat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.24,1:49:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,有本事过来抢 四眼田鸡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come and get it, four-eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:48.21,1:49:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静点 洛奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now cool it, Rocky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:51.15,1:49:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,别激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it easy, will you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:52.45,1:49:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里我才刚修好 我可是花了一大笔钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just had this joint fixed.It cost me a fortune.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.50,1:50:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:26.32,1:50:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,外带\N{\fnArial\fs30}This order's to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.19,1:50:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于你的损失我成到很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm terribly sorry about all the damage, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:42.43,1:50:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在练健身\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been working out.{\r}
